gantt
    title AstroFusion Research Timeline (2020-2025)
    dateFormat  YYYY-MM
    axisFormat  %Y

    section Phase 1: Data Collection
    USGS Seismic Data (1900-2024)      :done,    des1, 2020-01, 2020-06
    Swiss Ephemeris Integration        :done,    des2, 2020-03, 2020-08
    Gold Market Data (COMEX)           :done,    des3, 2020-06, 2020-09

    section Phase 2: Engine Development
    Core Astrological Engine (Python)  :active,  dev1, 2020-09, 2021-03
    Vedic Logic Implementation         :active,  dev2, 2021-01, 2021-06
    Statistical Module (SciPy/Stats)   :         dev3, 2021-04, 2021-09

    section Phase 3: Analysis & Validation
    Track 1: Numerology Sync Test      :         test1, 2021-10, 2022-02
    Track 2: Seismic Backtesting       :         test2, 2022-03, 2023-01
    Track 3: Financial Granger Tests   :         test3, 2023-02, 2023-08

    section Phase 4: Synthesis
    Peer Review & Refinement           :         syn1, 2023-09, 2024-12
    Master Thesis Compilation          :crit,    syn2, 2025-01, 2025-06
